  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_a_01",
      "hash64": "374EC4ECC983AA5C",
      "text": "这里是天星队\\n边缘分子之家。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_a_02",
      "hash64": "374EC7ECC983AF75",
      "text": "星尘？宣战公告？\\n……我们不知道啊。\\r\\n反正我们和本部的人也没什么联系。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_a_03",
      "hash64": "374EC6ECC983ADC2",
      "text": "虽然没办法招待你什么，\\n……这个就送给你吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_025_system_01",
      "hash64": "284BBDA29079A845",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]获得了\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]运动帽（星星）[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_a_04",
      "hash64": "374EC1ECC983A543",
      "text": "你想待到什么时候都行，\\n也可以随时离开。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_a_05",
      "hash64": "374EC0ECC983A390",
      "text": "这里是天星队\\n边缘分子之家。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_b_01",
      "hash64": "61CCBCE1801AED13",
      "text": "我们只是厌倦了队里的活动，\\n还瞒着其他人去上学了哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_c_01",
      "hash64": "5EDE10DC579B18FE",
      "text": "一如既往地充满活力，\\n今天星苦了～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_d_01",
      "hash64": "895C88D10E333535",
      "text": "这里谁也不会起争执，\\n所以比学校，比天星队，\\r\\n比家里都更自在。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
